{
  "id": "theremin-flutter",
  "name": "Theremin Flutter",
  "description": "Un LFO lent module le DEPTH d'un LFO rapide (nouvelle entrée Depth) qui pilote la hauteur du Theremin : un vibrato rapide dont l'intensité respire.",
  "group": "Theremin",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "lfo-mod",
        "type": "lfo",
        "name": "LFO Depth (lent)",
        "position": { "x": 40, "y": 60 },
        "params": { "rate": 0.2, "depth": 0.2, "offset": 0, "shape": "triangle", "bipolar": false }
      },
      {
        "id": "lfo-vib",
        "type": "lfo",
        "name": "LFO Vibrato (rapide)",
        "position": { "x": 40, "y": 460 },
        "params": { "rate": 7, "depth": 0.04, "offset": 0, "shape": "sine", "bipolar": true }
      },
      {
        "id": "theremin-1",
        "type": "theremin",
        "name": "Theremin",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 60 },
        "params": { "frequency": 440, "volume": 0.8, "touch": 0, "waveform": 0, "vibratoRate": 5, "vibratoDepth": 0, "tremoloRate": 5, "tremoloDepth": 0, "tone": 0.6, "glide": 0, "level": 0.75, "loFreq": 130.81, "hiFreq": 1046.5 }
      },
      {
        "id": "reverb-1",
        "type": "reverb",
        "name": "Reverb",
        "position": { "x": 1380, "y": 60 },
        "params": { "time": 1.1, "damp": 0.4, "preDelay": 24, "mix": 0.38 }
      },
      {
        "id": "out-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Main Out",
        "position": { "x": 1660, "y": 60 },
        "params": { "level": 1 }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 520 },
        "params": {
          "text": "THEREMIN FLUTTER\n\nLFO module LFO !\n\n- LFO Vibrato (rapide, 7 Hz) → entrée Pitch du Theremin → vibrato rapide.\n- LFO Depth (lent, 0.2 Hz) → entrée DEPTH du LFO Vibrato → l'AMPLEUR du vibrato respire (s'ouvre et se ferme).\n- Pas de gate → drone continu centré sur Do.\n\nÀ régler : le Rate du LFO Vibrato (plus rapide = trille), et le Depth/Rate du LFO lent (vitesse de respiration). Attrape le pad pour reprendre la main.\n\nSignal : Theremin → Reverb → Sortie."
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      { "from": { "moduleId": "lfo-mod", "portId": "cv-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "lfo-vib", "portId": "depth" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "lfo-vib", "portId": "cv-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "theremin-1", "portId": "pitch-in" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "theremin-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "out-1", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" }
    ]
  }
}
